; CCP - complete SpeedStart CP/M-86 disassembly.
; CODE offsets 0000h..0A00h (end exclusive); loaded in segment 0051h.
; Instructions recovered from the original kernel; data and padding are explicit.
; Address comments refer to decoded CODE, excluding the 128-byte CMD header.
; make check verifies the entire reassembled kernel against base/speed.str.
	cseg
	org	00000h

